msgctxt "56_Loan Shark"
msgid "What the fuck are you...?"
msgstr "Ayyyy... Auuuu... ¿Qué demonios eres tú...?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, sorry, I should've told you. I'm stronger than I look."
msgstr "Puede que no lo parezca, pero soy más fuerte de lo que aparento. Perdón por los golpecitos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "80_Loan Shark"
msgid "Dammit! You'll pay for this!"
msgstr "¡M-mierda! ¡¡Pagarás por esto!! El equipo de usureros fue vencido otra vez..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Never heard that one before... Do people really still talk\\r\nlike that?"
msgstr "Qué curioso... aún hay gente que suelta ese tipo de frases."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "(Okay, time to see how Shoko-san's doing.)"
msgstr "(Bien, ahora... es momento de ver como le va a Shoko-san)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "200_Shoko"
msgid "Akiyama-san? What are you doing here?"
msgstr "¡¿Akiyama-san?! ¿Qué haces aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, er..."
msgstr "Oh, eh..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "224_Shoko"
msgid "Wait a minute. Have you been following me?"
msgstr "Un momento. ¿Me estabas siguiendo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "No, I was just in the neighborhood collecting a debt. What\\r\nhave you been up to?"
msgstr "No, no, solo andaba por el vecindario recolectando unas deudas. ¿Y tú? ¿Qué estabas haciendo Shoko-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "248_Shoko"
msgid "Me...? That doesn't really matter, does it? It has nothing\\r\nto do with you, after all."
msgstr "¿Yo...? ¿Qué importa? Eso no es asunto suyo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "Fair enough. By the way, did you figure out how to spend\\r\nthat million yen yet?"
msgstr "Va, va. Por cierto, ¿ya gastaste ese millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "284_Shoko"
msgid "No, not yet... Why? Are you curious?"
msgstr "No, aún no... ¿Por qué? ¿Tienes curiosidad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Not especially. I mean, I gave you that money. It's yours to\\r\ndo with as you please."
msgstr "No, no realmente. Quiero decir, yo solo fui quien te dio el dinero. Lo que hagas con él al final es cosa tuya."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "308_Shoko"
msgid "Yes, well... I have someplace else I'd like to go, so if\\r\nyou'll excuse me..."
msgstr "Sí, bueno... Tengo un lugar al que quiero ir, así que si me disculpas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "332_Akiyama"
msgid "(Someplace else she'd like to go? Where's she headed now?)"
msgstr "(¿Un lugar al que quieres ir? ¿A dónde piensas ir ahora, Shoko-san?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "Fair enough. By the way, did you spend that million yen yet?"
msgstr "Va, va. Por cierto, ¿ya gastaste ese millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "404_Shoko"
msgid "I've decided how I'll use it."
msgstr "Ya decidí en que lo gastaré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "Is that so? Well then, I'll await your decision back at Sky\\r\nFinance."
msgstr "¿En serio? Bueno, entonces estaré esperándote en Sky Finance."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "428_Shoko"
msgid "All right. I'll come by later."
msgstr "Sí... Me pasaré más tarde."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "Sounds good. I'll see you there."
msgstr "...De acuerdo. Nos vemos luego."

